stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Proposed : Relationship asserted

    Proposed --> Verified : Proof validated
    Proposed --> Disputed : Conflicting evidence

    Verified --> Active : Proof chain complete
    Verified --> Disputed : Challenge raised

    Active --> Suspended : Proof link challenged / expired
    Active --> Terminated : Termination proof recorded
    Active --> Disputed : Conflicting proof submitted

    Suspended --> Active : Challenge resolved / re-attested
    Suspended --> Terminated : Not reinstated

    Disputed --> Active : Resolution favors assertion
    Disputed --> Terminated : Resolution invalidates

    Terminated --> [*]
    Active --> [*] : Normal end

    note right of Disputed
        State transitions driven
        by proof chain events only.
        No direct field updates.
    end note

    note right of Suspended
        Auto-suspended when:
        - KYC expires
        - Mandate expires
        - Proof link challenged
    end note
